{"strongs": "H0669", "word": "אֶפְרַ֫יִם", "translit": "eph.ra.yim", "root": "אפר", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Ephraim", "definition": "אֶפְרַ֫יִם proper name, masculine Ephraim ( Gen 41:52 connected with הִפְרָה , Hiph`il of פרה , compare פרא Hiph`il Hos 13:15 ). 1. 2nd son of Joseph Gen 41:52 ; Gen 46:20 reckoned among sons of Jacob, blessed by him, and given preference over Manasseh Gen 48:1 ; Gen 48:5 ; Gen 48:13 ; Gen 48:14 ; Gen 48:17 (twice in verse) (compare v Gen 48:19 ) v Gen 48:20 v Gen 48:20 ; Gen 50:23 ; Num 1:10 ; 1Chr 7:20 ; 1Chr 7:22 . 2. בְּנֵי אֶפְרַיִם (= descendants, tribe of east) Num 1:32 ; Num 2:18 (twice in verse); Num 2:24 ; Num 7:48 ; Num 10:22 ; Num 26:35 ; Num 26:37 ; Josh 16:5 ; Josh 16:9 (boundaries of territory), Josh 17:8 ; 1Chr 9:3 ; 1Chr 12:31 ; 1Chr 27:10 ; 1Chr 27:14 ; 1Chr 27:20 ; 1Chr 2:12 less often ׳ מַטֵּה א Num 1:33 ; Num 13:8 ; Josh 21:5 ; 1Chr 6:51 ׳ מַטֵּה בְנֵיאֿ Num 34:24 ; Josh 16:8 compare Josh 14:4 ׳ שֵׁבֶט א Ps 78:67 (|| אֹהֶל יוֺסֵף ); ׳ בֵּית א Judg 10:9 also ׳ א alone, tribe Ephraim Num 26:28 ; Deut 33:17 ; Josh 16:10 + often; וּמְנַשֶּׁה ׳ אֶרֶין א Josh 17:17 compare Judg 12:15 ; 2Chr 30:10 especially 3. הַראֶֿפְרַיִם the mountain-country of Ephraim , a ridge stretching from north to south through territory assigned to Ephraim, with fruitful land on both slopes, especially the western (compare Di Josh 16:1 ) Josh 17:15 ; Josh 19:50 ; Josh 20:7 ; Judg 2:9 ; Judg 3:27 ; Judg 4:5 + 26 t. 4. by Hosea & Isaiah (rarely later) אֶפְרַיִם = kingdom of northern Israel (from Ephraim as largest & strongest tribe in it) Hos 4:17 ; Hos 5:3 (twice in verse); Hos 5:5 (|| יִשְׂרָאֵל ) v Hos 5:11 v Hos 5:12 + 30 t. Hosea; Isa 7:2 ; Isa 7:5 ; Isa 7:8 ; Isa 7:9 ; Isa 7:17 + 9 t. Isaiah; also Jer 7:15 ; Jer 31:9 ; Jer 31:18 ; Jer 31:20 ; Ezek 37:16 (strike out Co ) v Ezek 37:19 ; Ps 78:9 ; 2Chr 25:7 ; 2Chr 25:10 compare 2Chr 30:1 ; Ps 60:9 = Ps 108:9 ׳ עָרֵי א 2Chr 17:2 compare 2Chr 34:6 ׳ שְׂדֵה א Obad 1:19 hence ׳ א alone in local sense 2Chr 31:1 also Hos 5:9 , where feminine (& perhaps Isa 7:2 ). 5. יִעַר אֶפְרַיִם 2Sam 18:6 , east of Jordan; ᵐ5 L Klo read יער מַחֲנַיִם compare 2Sam 17:24 ; 2Sam 17:27 . 6. name of a city near Baal-hazor 2Sam 13:23 (= Ἐφραϊμ John 11:54 & 1 Macc 11:34? Klo compare ᵐ5 L Γοφραιμ & עפרון , Qr עֶפְרַיִן 2Chr 13:9 so previously Bö Th Ke compare Dr ). 7. שַׁעַר אֶפְרַיִם a chief gate of Jerusalem 2Kgs 14:13 ; 2Chr 25:23 ; Neh 8:16 ; Neh 12:39 perhaps at northwest angle, near Holy Sepulchre, compare Schick-Guthe ZPV 1885 . אֶפְרָת see אפרתה . below", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB687')\">BDB687</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H669')\">H669</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB686')\">BDB686</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB688')\">BDB688</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֶפְרַ֫יִם</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>Ephraim</highlightword> (<ref ref=\"Gen 41:52\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,52)\">Gen 41:52</ref> connected with <bdbheb>הִפְרָה</bdbheb>, Hiph`il of <bdbheb>פרה</bdbheb>, compare <bdbheb>פרא</bdbheb> Hiph`il <ref ref=\"Hos 13:15\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,15)\">Hos 13:15</ref>). <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> 2nd son of Joseph <ref ref=\"Gen 41:52\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,52)\">Gen 41:52</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,20)\">Gen 46:20</ref> reckoned among sons of Jacob, blessed by him, and given preference over Manasseh <ref ref=\"Gen 48:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,48,1)\">Gen 48:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 48:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,48,5)\">Gen 48:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 48:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"48\" vBeg